Z||000002||Cplensdorf||02-24-2001||09:01 PM||||Make sure you use the correct grease when reassembling.  Only high temp disc brake grease or you will be at it again.  This coming from experience.  It probably ran hot or dry and just seized.  Replace spindle, bearings and you are on the road again.<P>||||reg||1
